  <entity00164779:DescriptionOfExchangeableBondsClassifiedAsCurrentBondsOfDisclosureOfExchangeableBondsClassifiedAsCurrentBondsOfDisclosureOfExchangeableBondsClassifiedAsCurrentBondsTableOfItems contextRef="CFY2025dFQA_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedAndSeparateFinancialStatementsAxis_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedMember_ifrs-full_BorrowingsByNameAxis_entity00164779_ExchangeableBondsOfBorrowingsByNameMemberOfDisclosureOfExchangeableBondsClassifiedAsCurrentBondsTableOfMember" xml:lang="ko">2023년 중 연결회사가 발행한 교환사채를 포함하고 있으며, 교환사채의 만기는 2030년이나 교환권의 행사가능성으로 인해 유동성사채로 분류하였습니다. 전기 중 USD 35,200,000에 해당하는 421,086주가 교환권 행사로 인해 교환되었으며, 동 교환사채의 발행조건은 다음과 같습니다.</entity00164779:DescriptionOfExchangeableBondsClassifiedAsCurrentBondsOfDisclosureOfExchangeableBondsClassifiedAsCurrentBondsOfDisclosureOfExchangeableBondsClassifiedAsCurrentBondsTableOfItems>
  <ifrs-full:BorrowingsMaturity contextRef="CFY2025dFQA_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedAndSeparateFinancialStatementsAxis_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedMember_ifrs-full_BorrowingsByNameAxis_entity00164779_GlobalExchangeableBondInForeignCurrencyMemberOfBorrowingsByNameMemberOfDisclosureOfConditionsForTheIssuanceOfExchangeableBondTableOfMember" xml:lang="ko">2030년 04월 11일</ifrs-full:BorrowingsMaturity>
  <entity00164779:ExchangeRatioBondsIssuedOfDisclosureOfConditionsForTheIssuanceOfExchangeableBondOfDisclosureOfConditionsForTheIssuanceOfExchangeableBondTableOfItems contextRef="CFY2025dFQA_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedAndSeparateFinancialStatementsAxis_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedMember_ifrs-full_BorrowingsByNameAxis_entity00164779_GlobalExchangeableBondInForeignCurrencyMemberOfBorrowingsByNameMemberOfDisclosureOfConditionsForTheIssuanceOfExchangeableBondTableOfMember" xml:lang="ko">사채원금의 100%</entity00164779:ExchangeRatioBondsIssuedOfDisclosureOfConditionsForTheIssuanceOfExchangeableBondOfDisclosureOfConditionsForTheIssuanceOfExchangeableBondTableOfItems>
  <entity00164779:ExchangeSubjectBondsIssuedOfDisclosureOfConditionsForTheIssuanceOfExchangeableBondOfDisclosureOfConditionsForTheIssuanceOfExchangeableBondTableOfItems contextRef="CFY2025dFQA_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedAndSeparateFinancialStatementsAxis_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedMember_ifrs-full_BorrowingsByNameAxis_entity00164779_GlobalExchangeableBondInForeignCurrencyMemberOfBorrowingsByNameMemberOfDisclosureOfConditionsForTheIssuanceOfExchangeableBondTableOfMember" xml:lang="ko">SK하이닉스 주식회사 발행 기명식 보통 주식(자기주식)</entity00164779:ExchangeSubjectBondsIssuedOfDisclosureOfConditionsForTheIssuanceOfExchangeableBondOfDisclosureOfConditionsForTheIssuanceOfExchangeableBondTableOfItems>
