  <entity00164779:PrincipalPaymentMethodBondsIssuedOfDisclosureOfConditionsForTheIssuanceOfExchangeableBondOfDisclosureOfConditionsForTheIssuanceOfExchangeableBondTableOfItems contextRef="CFY2025dFQA_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedAndSeparateFinancialStatementsAxis_ifrs-full_SeparateMember_ifrs-full_BorrowingsByNameAxis_entity00164779_GlobalExchangeableBondInForeignCurrencyMemberOfBorrowingsByNameMemberOfDisclosureOfConditionsForTheIssuanceOfExchangeableBondTableOfMember" xml:lang="ko">1) 만기상환 : 만기까지 교환권 및 조기상환권의 미행사에 따른 잔존 사채원리금에 대해 만기 일시상환
2) 조기상환 : 회사의 조기상환권(Call Option) 및 사채권자의 조기상환권(Put Option) 존재</entity00164779:PrincipalPaymentMethodBondsIssuedOfDisclosureOfConditionsForTheIssuanceOfExchangeableBondOfDisclosureOfConditionsForTheIssuanceOfExchangeableBondTableOfItems>
  <entity00164779:PutOptionByTheInvestorBondsIssuedOfDisclosureOfConditionsForTheIssuanceOfExchangeableBondOfDisclosureOfConditionsForTheIssuanceOfExchangeableBondTableOfItems contextRef="CFY2025dFQA_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedAndSeparateFinancialStatementsAxis_ifrs-full_SeparateMember_ifrs-full_BorrowingsByNameAxis_entity00164779_GlobalExchangeableBondInForeignCurrencyMemberOfBorrowingsByNameMemberOfDisclosureOfConditionsForTheIssuanceOfExchangeableBondTableOfMember" xml:lang="ko">납입일로부터 4년 (2027. 04. 11)이 되는 날.
지배기업의 지배권 변동(Change of Control)이 발생하는 경우.
지배기업 발행주식이 상장폐지되거나 20 연속 거래일 이상 거래정지되는 경우.</entity00164779:PutOptionByTheInvestorBondsIssuedOfDisclosureOfConditionsForTheIssuanceOfExchangeableBondOfDisclosureOfConditionsForTheIssuanceOfExchangeableBondTableOfItems>
